ad('ad-account-restricted-negative-feedback-and-low-quality-ads', 'Ad Account Restricted for Negative Feedback',
 'Meta ad account restricted after negative feedback on your ads?', 'Restricted after negative feedback',
 'Ad account restricted after many hides, reports or low ad quality? What the system reads, what to change and how to appeal.',
 'Hides, reports and angry comments can lead to a restriction even when the ad follows policy.',
 'Negative feedback such as hides, reports and complaints, a low ad quality signal or many comments about the product can lead to a restriction. Look at which ads draw the feedback, pause them, fix the targeting, creative and promise, answer genuine complaints, and appeal once with a note on what changed.',
 [('Find the ads that draw it', 'Check which ads draw hides and reports and pause them first.'),
  ('Fix targeting and claims', 'Ads that reach the wrong people or claim too much draw complaints.'),
  ('Answer genuine comments', 'Replies show the account is run by a real business.')],
 ['Targeting that reaches people who do not want it.', 'Creative that claims more than the product does.', 'Comments about delivery or returns that go unanswered.', 'A sudden jump in frequency.'],
 ['Open Account Quality and note the ads named.', 'Pause the ads that draw feedback.', 'Fix targeting, creative and the landing page.', 'Appeal once and send us the notice if it stays restricted.'],
 [('Can a competitor cause this?', 'Reports from others can contribute, but genuine complaints weigh more.'),
  ('Should I turn off comments?', 'Replying and moderating is better than hiding everything.'),
  ('Does lowering frequency help?', 'It often reduces hides and negative feedback.')],
 ['Stores with many complaints.', 'Advertisers with aggressive creative.', 'Agencies managing several accounts.'])
